forcurves.com, curvybbw.com, curvydate.com, bigcurvylove.com, curvy-bbw-dating.com, curvymeet.com, fullfiguredating.com etc etc etc... they're not desperate <strong>at all</strong> either.</p>"],[1,6574499,0,14,0,14,"2016-10-16T02:43:39","XD40","",[],"<p>lol they're all ham dating sites. </p>"],[1,6574550,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-16T02:54:55","NoFun","",[],"<p>Everyone should just make accounts on that site just to reject people.</p>"],[2,6574679,6574550,2,0,2,"2016-10-16T03:17:55","journalistsarelazy","",[],"<p>My profile would say &quot;no fatties&quot; just to be extra pointless. </p>"],[1,6574618,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-16T03:05:31","th3st0rmtr00p3r","",[],"<p>Somebody should reverse catfish</p>"],[1,6574675,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-16T03:15:40","jlx","",[],"<p>I first saw this commercial at about 3 AM one night at the gym. Husband and I were on elliptical machines and we both took our ear buds out at the same time and said something along the lines of &quot;seriously?&quot;</p>\n<p>Gave us even more motivation to kick it into high gear.</p>"],[1,6574912,0,5,0,5,"2016-10-16T04:02:06","Kaleidowave","",[],"<p>I fully support hams having their own dating site if it means they spend less time sending me messages on mine like we're in the same league.</p>"],[2,6578458,6574912,1,0,1,"2016-10-16T17:54:05","ScootyPoofTipper","",[],"<p>They're the reason I deleted mine. I'll just try to meet someone the old fashioned way. You can't catfish real life.</p>"],[1,6575069,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-16T04:37:25","Adipemgensodio","",[],"<p>I love curvy women. Stop trying to fuck up what curvy means you stupid fat cunts.</p>"],[1,6575474,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-16T06:04:49","nofatchix","",[],"<p>Most people on match are already fat so there is no difference here. Average woman size is a 16. Mother of god. I cant blame them for trying to.capitalize on fatties though. Ive been buying stock in insulin companies and mobility scooters. Make me rich you fat shits.</p>"],[1,6575613,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-16T06:45:57","FatsoMcgee",